{"id":"wb-5-265","name":"小会岭二仙庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"小会岭二仙庙","text":"小会岭二仙庙位于中国山西省晋城市陵川县附城镇小会村，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n小会岭二仙庙坐北朝南，南北长49.8米，东西宽25.5米，中轴线上有山门、献厅、正殿，两侧有垛楼、廊屋、配殿、耳殿，其中正殿为宋代建筑，余为明清所建。献厅为清代建筑，面阔三间，进深一间，单檐卷棚顶。正殿面阔三间，进深六椽，单檐歇山顶。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E4%BC%9A%E5%B2%AD%E4%BA%8C%E4%BB%99%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94365459,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94365459","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e2a5fcd3c77bc76e44879ac8.jpg","title":"20260814_Xiaohuiling_Erxian_Temple_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260814_Xiaohuiling_Erxian_Temple_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e4/20260814_Xiaohuiling_Erxian_Temple_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西陵川 小会岭二仙庙","width":320,"height":213}}